     =20
      <h1>BlueWallet for Windows is out</h1>
     =20
      <p>This is the first Bitcoin-only wallet available for Windows deskto=
p. It=E2=80=99s a huge effort from the team to bring our desktop product to=
 the broader Bitcoin community.</p>
     =20
      <p>With a desktop product, we can ship a wallet with full node suppor=
t and all the privacy gains that come with it. Which I bet some of you will=
 appreciate.</p>
     =20
      <p>Let=E2=80=99s see what you can do right from the start:</p>
     =20
      <p>
        <strong>HWW integration:</strong> Connect to your hardware wallet t=
hrough watch-only and PSBTs support.<br><br>
        <strong>Plausible Deniability:</strong> Create multiple storages or=
 fake ones in case of a forced disclosure.<br><br>
        <strong>Multiple Wallets:</strong> Support for Bip84/49/44, electru=
m, and legacy formats.<br><br>
